WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.510
Everyone in the room gasped.

2
00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:21.081
"You want to assassinate Dong Zhuo?" Wang Yun shook his head.

3
00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:24.504
"Cao Cao, it's too dangerous."

4
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:29.589
Cao Cao looked around the room. "Dong Zhuo trusts me.

5
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.250
In fact, I'm supposed to meet with him tomorrow."

6
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:40.410
A tall man sighed. "It might be our only option."

7
00:00:40.922 --> 00:00:43.774
The others slowly nodded.

8
00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:47.190
Wang Yun left the room and came back with a dagger.

9
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.950
"This is called the seven-star dagger.

10
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.930
It has been in my family for many years.

11
00:00:55.755 --> 00:01:01.607
Please use it to save our empire." He handed it to Cao Cao.

12
00:01:01.608 --> 00:01:08.255
Cao Cao admired the dagger. "Perfect. This will be easy to hide."

13
00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:14.670
He slipped it into his robe and looked around the room. "I will not fail you."

14
00:01:15.057 --> 00:01:21.342
The next afternoon Cao Cao went to Dong Zhuo's house.

15
00:01:21.343 --> 00:01:25.657
Dong Zhuo lay on a couch.

16
00:01:25.658 --> 00:01:32.671
"You're late," Dong Zhuo grumbled. He looked tired.

17
00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:39.970
"I'm sorry," Cao Cao said. "My horse is old and weak. It cannot run fast."

18
00:01:41.213 --> 00:01:43.921
Dong Zhuo called to a servant.

19
00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:49.050
"Go to the stable. Pick out a good horse for Cao Cao."

20
00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.430
The servant nodded and hurried away.

21
00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:57.330
Cao Cao pretended to be grateful. "Thank you, sir."

22
00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.540
He sat, and the two men talked.

23
00:02:03.276 --> 00:02:10.193
As Dong Zhuo told stories about fighting Yellow Turbans, Cao Cao grew impatient.

24
00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:17.460
"What a liar," Cao Cao thought. "I heard he hid behind a barrel during one fight."

25
00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:24.460
But he listened politely. After a little while, Dong Zhuo yawned.

26
00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.400
"I'm not feeling well today," Dong Zhuo said.

27
00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:38.060
"I think I'll take a nap." He closed his eyes and soon began to snore.

28
00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:47.037
"Now," Cao Cao thought. He pulled out the dagger and inched closer.

29
00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.810
A large mirror stood behind the couch.

30
00:02:51.255 --> 00:02:54.421
Cao Cao could see his reflection in the mirror.

31
00:02:54.830 --> 00:03:01.337
Then he gulped. Dong Zhuo's reflection was staring directly at him!

32
00:03:01.338 --> 00:03:06.962
Dong Zhuo jumped up. "Guards!"

33
00:03:06.963 --> 00:03:11.681
As guards rushed into the room, Cao Cao dropped to his knees.

34
00:03:11.682 --> 00:03:17.546
He held out the seven-star dagger. "A gift for you, sir!"

35
00:03:17.547 --> 00:03:22.055
"What?" Dong Zhuo raised an eyebrow.

36
00:03:22.056 --> 00:03:29.215
"It's called the seven-star dagger," Cao Cao said. "It's quite valuable."

37
00:03:29.216 --> 00:03:38.488
Dong Zhuo took the dagger and looked at it closely. "Thank you."

38
00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:42.880
He waved the guards away and placed the dagger on a table.

39
00:03:43.866 --> 00:03:49.547
Cao Cao wiped a bead of sweat from his forehead.

40
00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.790
For the rest of the visit, he was so anxious, he could barely think.

41
00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:59.550
Finally he said, "I'm eager to see my new horse.

42
00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.910
Do you mind if I take it for a ride?"

43
00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:06.546
"Go ahead," Dong Zhuo said.

44
00:04:06.547 --> 00:04:11.650
Cao Cao went outside.

45
00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:15.550
"Dong Zhuo knows I planned to assassinate him," he thought.

46
00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:20.420
"He'll send soldiers after me. I must leave Luoyang at once!"

47
00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:28.830
He found the horse, jumped on, and raced away.

48
00:04:30.861 --> 00:04:34.797
Inside the house Dong Zhuo looked at the dagger.

49
00:04:34.798 --> 00:04:41.896
A chill ran down his spine. "Cao Cao intended to kill me."

50
00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.087
He called a guard into the room.

51
00:04:44.088 --> 00:04:54.421
"Cao Cao is a traitor," Dong Zhuo said. "I want him arrested!"

52
00:04:54.422 --> 00:05:00.296
For hours, Cao Cao rode fast toward his family home in Qiao.

53
00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:06.240
As he passed through a village, he saw wanted posters with his name.

54
00:05:07.547 --> 00:05:15.568
"Oh no!" Cao Cao rode faster.

55
00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:19.030
That night he hid in an empty barn and slept.

56
00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.970
He woke up early the next morning and continued his journey.

57
00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:30.150
After another day of riding, he began to feel safe.

58
00:05:30.771 --> 00:05:34.796
But that changed in Zhongmu County.

59
00:05:34.797 --> 00:05:39.254
Cao Cao came across a group of soldiers blocking the road.

60
00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:43.490
One soldier stepped forward, holding a "Wanted" poster.

61
00:05:44.134 --> 00:05:52.778
"Cao Cao! You're under arrest!"
